REGENERATED 2026-08-17T06:43:00Z under AMB-123 (M0 completion audit). This file and its four
siblings existed only on the authoring machine until then: `.gitignore`'s
`*.log` was written for ngspice scratch output and silently swallowed every
one, while nine tracked documents cited them as committed evidence. `git add`
on an ignored path does nothing unless forced, so nothing ever warned.

The previous contents were NOT carried forward verbatim. They recorded runs of
a pre-rename tree, carrying the project's former name, against decks that
have since changed, so
republishing them would have shipped a transcript that does not describe the
code in this commit. Everything below is captured output from a run made now,
against this tree.

