=== changes in this run (AMB-123) ===
CBYP 100 nF VCC bypass added; the design had no supply decoupling.
Duty window corrected from [52.4, 54.4] to [51.2, 55.6] %: the old one
omitted the timing-pin bias-current term, which scales with R and so was
multiplied tenfold by the 10k/68k -> 100k/680k rescale, putting the
NE555's own 0.25 uA datasheet corner outside the declared window. The
deck cannot measure this -- Bset/Bthr draw zero input current -- so the
simulated 53.45 % is the Ib = 0 row and always will be. See design.md.
